    "detailed_description": "*Game Overview *<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay as Commander Nora Walker as you traverse a dystopian Earth that is being ravaged by a trio of alien races --the Brutarian Orcs, Spatium Dwarves, and Stellar Fae. Whilst making your way through randomly generated maps, you'll uncover bits of story and be met with complex levels requiring you to strategize in order to conquer the foes before you. Command your units, be mindful of your energy, and watch the narrative play out to claim victory against your enemies in this narrative-driven rogue-lite deck builder.",
